<title>USA: Anchorage ISDFC, Ky., won by PNC Capital Mkts.</title>
<headline>Anchorage ISDFC, Ky., won by PNC Capital Mkts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Capital Markets said it won $1.075 million of Anchorage ISDFC, Ky., school building refunding revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.7782 percent.</p>
</text>
